Field `x` of class `Header`: `static` members are not supported (use a top-level function or const)
Method `m` of class `Signature`: `static` members are not supported (use a top-level function)
Method `m` of class `Body` must have a body
Parameter properties (`constructor(public x: number)`) are not supported; declare the field and assign it
Abstract classes are not supported
Method `m` of class `Member`: `static` members are not supported (use a top-level function)
Index signatures are not supported in class `Table` (object layout is fixed)
Interface inheritance (`extends`) is not supported; list every field
Unsupported object literal member: MethodDeclaration (only `key: value`)
`declare enum` is not supported
Classes must be named
